# Ghost Shift - Project Standards

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion
- Lucide React

## UI Guidelines
- Use Shadcn/UI components exclusively
- Mobile-first approach, optimized for portrait 9:16 ratio
- Responsive design for desktop viewing

## State Management
- Use React Context for global `gameState`
- Central State Machine manages game flow

## Visual Aesthetics
- Industrial noir theme
- Degrading visuals: starts crisp, becomes terminal-like
- Semi-transparent dark overlays with backdrop blur
- Glassmorphism effects for UI panels

## Code Standards
- TypeScript strict mode
- Component-based architecture
- Proper type definitions for all state
